---
// Demo — standard section grid (140px label + 1fr), matching every other
// content section on the page. Single static screenshot, self-hosted under
// public/assets/, hairline border, no chrome.
// saboteur-sites/sections/demo/README.md
---
<section class="border-b border-brand-rule px-6 py-14">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-[140px_1fr] md:gap-10 items-start">

    <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-fg-tertiary uppercase md:pt-1 pb-2 md:pb-0 border-b md:border-b-0 border-brand-rule">
      Demo
    </div>

    <figure>
      <img src="/assets/screenshot.png"
           alt="GetWrite writing interface"
           class="w-full border border-brand-dim" />
    </figure>

  </div>
</section>
